      "cooked": "<p>hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/gbrayj\">@GBrayJ</a> and <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/hemil_sangani\">@Hemil_Sangani</a></p>\n<p>Hope you all doing well.</p>\n<p>Was you able to solve the issue?</p>\n<p>I am struggling with this for so long.</p>\n<p>Please post the resolution if you have any.</p>",
