    {
      "id": 486869,
      "username": "mrsaxenanitin",
      "name": "NItin Saxena",
      "created_at": "2025-11-19T06:23:58.300Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The below code fixes the issue:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>proxy_set_header Host $host;<br>\nproxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;</p>\n<h1>Force public port (fixes :8080 issue)</h1>\n<p>proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Port 443;</p>\n<h1>Rewrite redirects coming from :8080</h1>\n<p>proxy_redirect ~^(https?://[^:]+):8080(/.*)$ $1$2;</p>\n</blockquote>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/90db22/{size}.png",
      "trust_level": 1,
      "post_number": 6,
      "post_type": 1,
