      "id": 486889,
      "username": "James-Richard",
      "name": null,
      "created_at": "2025-11-19T10:19:52.532Z",
      "cooked": "<p>It looks like the issue might be the port (<code>:8080</code>) in the redirect URL. Make sure your server is listening on that port and that it’s accessible externally, or try using the standard HTTPS port (443) to see if that resolves the hang.</p>",
